<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>計劃提交成功 - 旅遊易</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+TC:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    
    body { 
      font-family: 'Noto Sans TC', sans-serif; 
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: #2d3748;
    }
    
    .container { 
      max-width: 600px; 
      margin: 0 auto; 
      padding: 20px; 
    }
    
    .success-card { 
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.95); 
      border-radius: 20px; 
      padding: 50px 40px; 
      box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
      text-align: center;
      animation: slideIn 0.6s ease-out;
    }
    
    @keyframes slideIn {
      from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(30px);
      }
      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
    }
    
    .success-icon {
      font-size: 4rem;
      color: #48bb78;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      animation: bounce 1s ease-in-out;
    }
    
    @keyframes bounce {
      0%, 20%, 50%, 80%, 100% {
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
      40% {
        transform: translateY(-20px);
      }
      60% {
        transform: translateY(-10px);
      }
    }
    
    h1 {
      color: #2d3748;
      font-size: 2.2rem;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    
    .trip-info {
      background: #f7fafc;
      border-radius: 15px;
      padding: 25px;
      margin: 25px 0;
      border-left: 5px solid #667eea;
    }
    
    .trip-info h3 {
      color: #4a5568;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      font-size: 1.3rem;
    }
    
    .info-item {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      margin: 10px 0;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }
    
    .info-item i {
      color: #667eea;
      width: 25px;
      margin-right: 15px;
    }
    
    .trip-id {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
      color: white;
      padding: 15px 25px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin: 20px 0;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }
    
    .info-text {
      color: #718096;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    
    .actions {
      margin-top: 35px;
      display: flex;
      gap: 15px;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    
    .btn {
      padding: 15px 30px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 1rem;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    
    .btn-primary {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
      color: white;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.4);
    }
    
    .btn-primary:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.6);
    }
    
    .btn-secondary {
      background: #e2e8f0;
      color: #4a5568;
    }
    
    .btn-secondary:hover {
      background: #cbd5e0;
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }
    
    .timeline {
      background: #f0fff4;
      border: 1px solid #9ae6b4;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 25px 0;
    }
    
    .timeline h4 {
      color: #2f855a;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
    }
    
    .timeline-item {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      margin: 8px 0;
      color: #2f855a;
    }
    
    .timeline-item i {
      margin-right: 10px;
      width: 20px;
    }
    
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .container {
        padding: 15px;
      }
      
      .success-card {
        padding: 30px 25px;
      }
      
      h1 {
        font-size: 1.8rem;
      }
      
      .actions {
        flex-direction: column;
      }
      
      .btn {
        width: 100%;
        justify-content: center;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="success-card">
      <div class="success-icon">
        <i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>
      </div>
      
      <h1><i class="fas fa-heart"></i> 旅遊計劃提交成功！</h1>
      
      <div class="trip-id">
        <i class="fas fa-ticket-alt"></i> 您的旅遊計劃編號：<strong>#<%= id %></strong>
      </div>
      
      <div class="trip-info">
        <h3><i class="fas fa-map-marked-alt"></i> 您的旅程詳情</h3>
        <div class="info-item">
          <i class="fas fa-user"></i>
          <span><strong><%= trip.name %></strong></span>
        </div>
        <div class="info-item">
          <i class="fas fa-map-marker-alt"></i>
          <span>目的地：<strong><%= trip.destination %></strong></span>
        </div>
        <div class="info-item">
          <i class="fas fa-calendar-alt"></i>
          <span>出發日期：<strong><%= trip.startDate %></strong></span>
        </div>
        <div class="info-item">
          <i class="fas fa-clock"></i>
          <span>旅行天數：<strong><%= trip.duration %>天</strong></span>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="timeline">
        <h4><i class="fas fa-tasks"></i> 接下來會發生什麼？</h4>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <i class="fas fa-envelope"></i>
          <span>確認郵件已發送到您的信箱</span>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <i class="fas fa-robot"></i>
          <span>AI助理將在出發前3天開始工作</span>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <i class="fas fa-search"></i>
          <span>自動搜尋最佳航班、酒店和旅遊資訊</span>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <i class="fas fa-paper-plane"></i>
          <span>完整旅遊攻略將發送到您的郵箱</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <p class="info-text">
        <i class="fas fa-info-circle"></i>
        感謝您選擇旅遊易！我們的AI助理將為您精心準備最詳細的旅遊攻略，包含最優惠的航班價格、精選酒店推薦、當地天氣預報和專業旅遊建議。
      </p>
      
      <div class="actions">
        <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary">
          <i class="fas fa-home"></i> 返回首頁
        </a>
        <a href="/trips/<%= id %>" class="btn btn-secondary">
          <i class="fas fa-eye"></i> 查看詳情
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>

